    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571410/extras/8d25fa6b6c6f99d2dcc9566f6735b1bb.avif?t=1745512964\" width=610 height=181 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KILLING IS EASY</h2>500 Caliber Contractz is a momentum-based 3D-Platformer in which you play as a contract killer hired via crowdfunding to murder CEOs, Disgraced Sinister Ex-Doctors, Private-Prison-Owning DJs, etc. With your handy high caliber sniper rifle and a chest full of anxiety, you can and will propel yourself to where you need to be. Collect tokens that float around for a reason I haven't bothered coming up with and then murder your target. Do it. Please.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MORE DETAILZ</h2>In this game you are given a large variety of moves and plopped into an open level to explore as you please. Each level contains multiple contracts that each have their own unique target as well as a few extra tasks to complete. There is also a bunch of things to collect including Assassin Tokens, Money$$$, and a bunch of outfits for the main character, including some cameos from games made by my friends :O<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATUREZ</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>About 3 Levels<br></li><li>Multiple Contractz Per Level<br></li><li>A bunch of cool outfits<br></li><li>Lil cigarette guys you can shoot<br></li><li>Maybe some secrets idk</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREDITZ:</h2>Created By: Bryce Bucher<br><br>Music: Modus Interactive, Shinigami, JAM2GO<br>Additional Programming: Feverdream Johnny<br>Additional Assets: Modus Interactive<br>Promotional Very Cool Key Art Illustration: \u0442\u0443\u0440\u0431\u043e\u0436\u0430\u0431\u0430",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571410/extras/8d25fa6b6c6f99d2dcc9566f6735b1bb.avif?t=1745512964\" width=610 height=181 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KILLING IS EASY</h2>500 Caliber Contractz is a momentum-based 3D-Platformer in which you play as a contract killer hired via crowdfunding to murder CEOs, Disgraced Sinister Ex-Doctors, Private-Prison-Owning DJs, etc. With your handy high caliber sniper rifle and a chest full of anxiety, you can and will propel yourself to where you need to be. Collect tokens that float around for a reason I haven't bothered coming up with and then murder your target. Do it. Please.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MORE DETAILZ</h2>In this game you are given a large variety of moves and plopped into an open level to explore as you please. Each level contains multiple contracts that each have their own unique target as well as a few extra tasks to complete. There is also a bunch of things to collect including Assassin Tokens, Money$$$, and a bunch of outfits for the main character, including some cameos from games made by my friends :O<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATUREZ</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>About 3 Levels<br></li><li>Multiple Contractz Per Level<br></li><li>A bunch of cool outfits<br></li><li>Lil cigarette guys you can shoot<br></li><li>Maybe some secrets idk</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREDITZ:</h2>Created By: Bryce Bucher<br><br>Music: Modus Interactive, Shinigami, JAM2GO<br>Additional Programming: Feverdream Johnny<br>Additional Assets: Modus Interactive<br>Promotional Very Cool Key Art Illustration: \u0442\u0443\u0440\u0431\u043e\u0436\u0430\u0431\u0430",
